ice × 0.5","ruleHow":"compareAt × 0.5","diff":"Difference per item"}}]}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","section","0",{"className":"grid gap-4 border-t border-fg pt-5 pb-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,8fr)] lg:gap-[var(--gut)]","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)]","children":"Context"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[66ch] space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.62]","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["Integralmédica and Darkness are supplement brands sharing one Shopify admin and one repository: two headless storefronts with a cart shared between them. I joined halfway through development and took over as tech lead. From then on, every feature and every decision went through me, and I built most of the features myself."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","1",{"className":"grid gap-4 border-t border-fg pt-5 pb-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,8fr)] lg:gap-[var(--gut)]","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)]","children":"The core technical problem"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[66ch] space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.62]","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["The shared cart was the known part. What made this project hard was something else: the sheer volume of business rules that simply don't exist in off-the-shelf Shopify. Supplements are a category with heavy promotional mechanics, and the client's requirements ran straight into the limits of the native checkout and account area. The recurring question wasn't “how do I configure this?” but “this doesn't exist, so what do we build?”"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","2",{"className":"grid gap-4 border-t border-fg pt-5 pb-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,8fr)] lg:gap-[var(--gut)]","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)]","children":"What I built"}],"$L12"]}],"$L13","$L14"]}]]}]
