oyalty program."]}]]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"border-t border-line py-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-1 block text-[0.9375rem] font-[680]","children":"Checkout blocks"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-muted","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["Checkout extensions that bring information and features into the most sensitive step of the purchase."]}]]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"border-t border-line py-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-1 block text-[0.9375rem] font-[680]","children":"Reporting and data integrations"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-muted","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["A range of reports, CRM integrations and third-party script integrations, with a significant amount of data flowing out of the store."]}]]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"border-t border-line py-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-1 block text-[0.9375rem] font-[680]","children":"Brand sections and landing pages"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-muted","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["Deeply customizable sections and pages, so the content team can work without waiting on a deploy."]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
13:["$","section","3",{"className":"grid gap-4 border-t border-fg pt-5 pb-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,8fr)] lg:gap-[var(--gut)]","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)]","children":"Why it's built this way"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[66ch] space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.62]","children":[["$","ul","0",{"className":"border-b border-line","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"border-t border-line py-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-1 block text-[0.9375rem] font-[680]","children":"The native account doesn't survive two brands"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-muted","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["Shopify gives you one account area per admin — and here one admin serves two brands. In practice, that means identical styling for Integralmédica and Darkness, without even a per-brand logo: half the customers would log in and see the other brand. On top of that, there's no control over how orders are displayed or filtered, and no way to add a tab, and we needed “My benefits,” wired into the loyalty program. Rebuilding the whole account area was cheaper than fighting all three limits at once."]}]]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"border-t border-line py-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-1 block text-[0.9375rem] font-[680]","children":"A custom app instead of a marketplace subscription"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-muted","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["The promotion the client wanted doesn't exist natively. The obvious path was to subscribe to an App Store app and move on, adding a permanent monthly line to their budget. I built a custom app instead: once it's installed and the gift products are configured, it needs no recurring maintenance and has no subscription. I traded a permanent monthly cost for a one-time build cost, and that only makes sense because the rule is stable. If the mechanic changed every campaign, the off-the-shelf app would win."]}]]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"border-t border-line py-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-1 block text-[0.9375rem] font-[680]","children":"Promotion rules on Shopify, not in the front-end"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-muted","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["The promotional mechanics were implemented as Shopify Functions, on the platform side. A discount that only exists in the front-end is a discount that vanishes at checkout — and checkout is where the customer decides whether they trust the store."]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
14:["$","section","4",{"className":"grid gap-4 border-t border-fg pt-5 pb-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,8fr)] lg:gap-[var(--gut)]","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)]","children":"Status"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[66ch] space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.62]","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["Integralmédica and Darkness are in production. Both storefronts are live if you want to inspect them."]}]]}]]}]]}]
